<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Retention actions failed — ChurnGuard</title>
  <style>
    /* ── Reset ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    body, table, td, p, a, li, blockquote {
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0; mso-table-rspace: 0; }
    img { border: 0; line-height: 100%; outline: none; text-decoration: none; }

    /* ── Tokens ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    body { background-color: #F5F0E8; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    /* ── Fonts ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@400;600&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap');
  </style>
</head>
<body style="background-color:#F5F0E8; margin:0; padding:0; font-family:'Instrument Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">

  <!-- Outer wrapper -->
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
         style="background-color:#F5F0E8;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">

        <!-- Card -->
        <table width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
               style="background:#FFFDF9; border-radius:12px;
                      border:1px solid #EBE4DB; max-width:560px; width:100%;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:40px 40px 32px;">

              <!-- Header: logo + wordmark -->
              <p style="margin:0 0 32px; font-family:'Instrument Sans',Arial,sans-serif;
                         font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:#8A7E6F;
                         letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;">
                ChurnGuard
              </p>

              <!-- Alert icon -->
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:32px; line-height:1;">⚠️</p>

              <!-- Heading -->
              <h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;
                          font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;
                          font-size:28px; font-weight:600; color:#1A1410;
                          letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.2;">
                <%= @failed_count %>
                <%= @failed_count == 1 ? "retention action" : "retention actions" %>
                failed to send
              </h1>

              <!-- Sub-heading -->
              <p style="margin:0 0 28px; font-size:15px; color:#6B5C4A; line-height:1.6;">
                ChurnGuard could not reach Klaviyo after multiple attempts.
                Your customers are still being monitored — no action was lost —
                but the discount campaigns were not delivered.
              </p>

              <!-- Divider -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-top:1px solid #EBE4DB; padding-bottom:28px;"></td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Detail box -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                     style="background:#F0EAE0; border-left:3px solid #D4500A;
                             border-radius:0 8px 8px 0; margin-bottom:32px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 20px;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 6px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;
                               color:#8A7E6F; letter-spacing:0.06em;
                               text-transform:uppercase;">What happened</p>
                    <p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#4A3C2E; line-height:1.6;">
                      The connection between ChurnGuard and Klaviyo failed.
                      This usually means your Klaviyo API key is missing,
                      revoked, or your account has reached a plan limit.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Primary CTA -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                     style="margin-bottom:16px;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center"
                      style="background-color:#D4500A; border-radius:8px;">
                    <a href="<%= @settings_url %>"
                       style="display:block; padding:14px 24px;
                               font-family:'Instrument Sans',Arial,sans-serif;
                               font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#FFFFFF;
                               text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:0.01em;">
                      Check Klaviyo settings →
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Reassurance note -->
              <p style="margin:0; font-size:13px; color:#8A7E6F;
                         line-height:1.6; text-align:center;">
                Once your Klaviyo connection is restored, new actions will
                send automatically. Reply to this email if you need help.
              </p>

              <!-- Footer divider -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                     style="margin-top:32px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-top:1px solid #EBE4DB; padding-top:20px;">
                    <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#B0A594;
                               text-align:center; line-height:1.6;">
                      ChurnGuard · Automated retention for Shopify stores<br>
                      You're receiving this because a system alert was triggered
                      for <%= @shop.shopify_domain %>.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
